<title>USA: FFY Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>FFY Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTOWN, Ohio 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FFY Financial Corp said Wednesday said its board approved the repurchase of up to 1.5 million shares or 29.3 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company has 5.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be made through a &quot;modified Dutch auction tender,&quot; under which FFY Financial stockholders will be able to sell part or all of their shares to the company at a price of not less than $24.00 per share and not more than $26.00 per share.</p>
</text>
